@{ ViewData["Title"] = "About your data"; }
<h1>About your data</h1>
<p>RaceDay is a student event-management project. Use demonstration accounts and avoid submitting sensitive personal information.</p>
<h2 class="h4">Account and event information</h2>
<p>The API stores your name, email, password hash, entries and recorded results in its database. Your event organiser can see your name, category and result for their events.</p>
<h2 class="h4">Session cookies</h2>
<p>Essential session cookies keep you signed in. Use Logout when you finish, especially on a shared computer.</p>
<h2 class="h4">Your profile</h2>
<p>You can update your name and email through My Profile. Contact the project administrator for other account or data requests.</p>
